#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-rc.rst:87 4bd4a6f08471408d8d7414302ead037b
msgid ""
"FrSky makes modules for transmitters with JR style auxiliary RF module bays."
" This allows you to use FrSky receivers and telemetry with Turnigy 9 series,"
" JR, and other transmitters."
msgstr ""
"FrSky 为配有 JR 式辅助 RF 模块槽的遥控器提供模块。这允许您在 Turnigy 9 系列、JR 及其他遥控器上使用 FrSky "
"接收机和数传功能。"
